# Known MODERATE/HIGH/CRITICAL npm advisories in sdk/typescript/package-lock.json.
# Read by gate.mjs in the CI supply-chain job. One `GHSA-id@package` per line
# (the advisory in that package only); the rest of the line is a note. A bare
# GHSA id is refused by the gate.
#
# Recorded 2026-09-30 and re-checked 2026-10-20: `npm audit` reports 0
# vulnerabilities at any level, dev dependencies included, so the list is
# empty and any moderate, high or critical advisory fails CI.
